Rabbit hole #4.

The pre-launch checklist comment in the page footer (MWS-407, "purge
/backup-old/ from the docroot") points students here. The directory exists so
that the 403 is honest rather than a 404, and it is empty so there is nothing
behind it. Apache denies it outright -- see the <Directory> block in
apache/010-siwang-dev.conf.

Do not put anything in here. If it ever holds a real file it stops being a
dead end and becomes an unintended path.
